          }
        },
        "template--17736425439512__62a43239-c66d-4d9c-acc7-ea583570d59f-1675727252318684be-1": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Our health and wellness inspired EVOO. Best enjoyed as a shot in our Sip Glass or drizzled on your favorite foods. A bright and peppery mouth feel that also handles well cooked in heat. Comes in HEAL and HEAL+<br/><br/><strong>Uses</strong> - Consume daily in our Sip Glass for gut, brain and heart health, as well as its anti-inflammatory properties. You can also enjoy HEAL  & HEAL+ as a finishing oil to elevate the flavor of any dish. <br/></p>",
            "text_style": "body"
          }
        },
        "template--17736425439512__62a43239-c66d-4d9c-acc7-ea583570d59f-1675727252318684be-2": {
