        },
        "template--17736425439512__1b328408-daf1-4291-9517-7a76c9d465fe-1675727252318684be-1": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Our cooking inspired EVOO. A well-rounded flavor profile that perfectly enhances any dish. Enjoy cooking in heat or as a finishing oil.<br/><br/><strong>Uses</strong> - This olive oil works well with heat. Cook any of your favorite foods in a pan, oven or even an open flame, and let the olive oil naturally bring out the best flavors of your food.<br/></p><ul><li><strong>Single Origin</strong> - Central California</li><li><strong>Single Varietal</strong> - 100% Arbequina Olives</li><li><strong>Flavor Profile</strong> - Grassy, nutty, robust and well balanced.</li></ul>",
            "text_style": "body"
          }
        },
