          "settings": {
            "heading": "Flavor Profile",
            "icon": "serving_dish",
            "row_content": "<p><strong>Intensity & Flavor Profile: </strong>Medium - Bright, grassy and white peppery with a light finish.</p><p>The intensity of an EVOO relates to the amount of bitterness and peppery notes experienced while tasting. An olive oil that doesn’t tickle or burn the back of your throat is considered mild (low polyphenols - 100-200). A very peppery and bitter olive oil that will likely make you cough from the sensation on the back of your throat is considered strong (350-500+ polyphenols).</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
