        "template--17736425439512__7247e01d-63eb-4728-9555-c946cd8c4bc3-1675727269f96132c6-3": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How To Use",
            "icon": "check_mark",
            "row_content": "<p>Try taking a shot of this EVOO with the <a href=\"https://zimmsorganics.com/products/sip-glass\">Sip Glass</a> 15-30 minutes before consuming food in the morning. This may help with gut support / maintenance while repairing your intestinal tract over time (results may vary). The HEAL EVOO also functions beautifully as a finishing oil. HEAL pairs perfectly when drizzled over steak in a chimichurri or when used as the base of a salad dressing. HEAL handles well being cooked in heat as well because its 331 polyphenols (mg/kg) will protect the EVOO from oxidizing up to around 400-450 F.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
